python.code:
ways = [0] * (n + 1)
ways[0] = 1
for i in range(1, n + 1):
    ways[i] += ways[i - 1]
    if i >= 2:
        ways[i] += ways[i - 2]

java.code:
int[] ways = new int[n + 1];
ways[0] = 1;
for (int i = 1; i <= n; i++) {
    ways[i] += ways[i - 1];
    if (i >= 2) ways[i] += ways[i - 2];
}

javascript.code:
